,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-01-20T02:43:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T19:47:15Z","closed_at":"2026-01-29T00:03:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115158","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115158","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115158.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115158.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-29T00:03:46Z"},"body":"Dropping onready variables currently only takes the script's `class_name` into account. The parent's `class_name` was not used.\r\n\r\nFor example, in the screenshot below, the child node `RC` means it uses a regular script that extends a custom type, and `RRC` means it uses a regular script that extends another regular script that extends a custom type, etc.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"271\" height=\"217\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4cd33744-6c86-4da3-85f5-959727ac2340\" />\r\n\r\nDrag & drop them before this PR creates:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@onready var node_2d: Node2D = $Node2D\r\n@onready var c: CustomNode2D = $C\r\n@onready var rc: Node2D = $RC\r\n@onready var r: Node2D = $R\r\n@onready var rr: Node2D = $RR\r\n@onready var rrc: Node2D = $RRC\r\n```\r\n\r\nDrag & drop them after this PR creates:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@onready var node_2d: Node2D = $Node2D\r\n@onready var c: CustomNode2D = $C\r\n@onready var rc: CustomNode2D = $RC\r\n@onready var r: Node2D = $R\r\n@onready var rr: Node2D = $RR\r\n@onready var rrc: CustomNode2D = $RRC\r\n```\r\n\r\nTest project: [test-4.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24726736/test-4.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115158/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115158/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}